Package: oneplus-erhai-mesa
Version: 27.0.0~devel.git234733.g8df830aa844-1erhai1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TheMojoMan <themojoman@gmx.net>
Depends: libc6
Installed-Size: 0
Description: Mesa 27.0.0-devel (turnip/freedreno) for the OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai)
 This is the 26.10 (stonking) staging tree of the erhai Mesa build.  It is
 BUILD INPUT ONLY: update-mesa.sh keeps DEBIAN/control's Version in sync with
 the payload it stages under usr/, and build-mesa-usr-debs.sh splits that
 payload into the six Ubuntu-named replacement packages (libgbm1,
 mesa-libgallium, libgl1-mesa-dri, libglx-mesa0, libegl-mesa0,
 mesa-vulkan-drivers) that are actually installed.  The release-independent
 mesa-devel meta package in main pulls them in.
 .
 This package itself is never built or published.
